`<div style="position: relative; width: 600px; height: 1200px; overflow: hidden; background: #f4ece2"><div style="position: absolute; left: 16px; top: 16px; width: 564px; height: 1164px; border: 2px solid #94702f"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 23px; top: 23px; width: 552px; height: 1152px; border: 1px solid #94702f"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 11px; top: 11px; width: 12px; height: 12px; background: #5f1a26; transform: rotate(45deg)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 577px; top: 11px; width: 12px; height: 12px; background: #5f1a26; transform: rotate(45deg)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 11px; top: 1177px; width: 12px; height: 12px; background: #5f1a26; transform: rotate(45deg)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 577px; top: 1177px; width: 12px; height: 12px; background: #5f1a26; transform: rotate(45deg)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 50px; width: 508px"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #94702f; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; text-align: center;">From the kitchen</div><div style="margin-top: 6px"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><div style="flex: 1; height: 5px; border-top: 1.5px solid #94702f; border-bottom: 1px solid #94702f"></div><div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #94702f; transform: rotate(45deg); margin: 0 4px"></div><div style="font-family: 'Pirata One', serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05; color: #5f1a26; white-space: nowrap">The Family Table</div><div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #94702f; transform: rotate(45deg); margin: 0 4px"></div><div style="flex: 1; height: 5px; border-top: 1.5px solid #94702f; border-bottom: 1px solid #94702f"></div></div></div><div style="margin-top: 10px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #2b1d1b">Wedding soup</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.28; color: #2b1d1b; margin-top: 2px">Escarole and tiny veal meatballs in clear chicken brodo.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 12px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #2b1d1b">Don Corrado's baked ziti</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.28; color: #2b1d1b; margin-top: 2px">Slow sausage sugo, ricotta and mozzarella, baked until blistered.</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; color: #94702f; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 2px">The old man's favorite. Seconds are not optional.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 12px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #2b1d1b">Veal piccata</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.28; color: #2b1d1b; margin-top: 2px">Pounded thin, seared fast, white wine, lemon, capers and butter.</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; color: #94702f; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 2px">Charley's usual.</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 420px; width: 520px; height: 270px; background: #5f1a26; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 18px 22px 0"><div style="position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 6px; right: 6px; bottom: 6px; border: 1px solid #c49a55"></div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #d9b46a; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; text-align: center;">Pick one. Charley can't.</div><div style="font-family: 'Pirata One', serif; font-size: 48px; line-height: 1.05; color: #f4ece2; text-align: center; margin-top: 6px">Ice Her? Marry Her?</div><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 10px"><div style="width: 216px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'Pirata One', serif; font-size: 54px; line-height: 1; color: #d9b46a">Ice</div><div style="margin-top: 6px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.12; color: #f4ece2">Lemon ice</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.28; color: #ecdcd0; margin-top: 2px">Shaved fine, sharp and cold. Quick, and very clean.</div></div></div><div style="width: 1px; height: 150px; background: #c49a55; margin-top: 8px"></div><div style="width: 216px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'Pirata One', serif; font-size: 54px; line-height: 1; color: #d9b46a">Marry</div><div style="margin-top: 6px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.12; color: #f4ece2">Wedding amaretti</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.28; color: #ecdcd0; margin-top: 2px">Crackled almond cookies in icing sugar, tied in tulle.</div></div></div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 712px; width: 340px"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #94702f; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; text-align: center; text-align: left">At the sweet table</div><div style="font-family: 'Pirata One', serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05; color: #5f1a26; margin-top: 4px">The Don's Sweets</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 790px; width: 236px; height: 176px; border: 3px solid #94702f; outline: 1px solid #5f1a26; outline-offset: 2px"><img src="assets/era/prizzis/don-sweets-6a4d48.webp" alt="Don Corrado holds his granddaughter's hands at a garden table set with fruit and a coffee pot" style="display: block; width: 236px; height: 176px"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 978px; width: 244px; font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.2; color: #6b5a52">The Don, Sunday coffee in the garden.</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 306px; top: 822px; width: 250px"><div style="margin-top: 0px; text-align: left"><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.12; color: #2b1d1b">Confetti almonds</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.28; color: #2b1d1b; margin-top: 2px">Sugared, five to a bag: health, wealth, happiness, children, long life.</div></div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #5f1a26; margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.04em">THE DON TAKES FIRST PICK. WAIT.</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 306px; top: 984px; width: 250px; font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: #2b1d1b">Eat. Enjoy. Nobody leaves before the cake. Nobody.</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 330px; top: 1032px; font-family: 'Pinyon Script', cursive; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; color: #5f1a26">Corrado Prizzi</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 1074px; width: 508px; border-top: 1.5px solid #94702f; padding-top: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline"><div style="font-family: 'Pirata One', serif; font-size: 28px; color: #5f1a26; line-height: 1">The Toast</div><div style="font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.2; color: #2b1d1b"><b>White peach Bellini</b> &middot; <b>Espresso, anisette</b></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 1116px; width: 508px; text-align: center; font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; color: #6b5a52">With the compliments of the family. Envelopes to Angelo at the door.<br>Printed for the reception, 720 Court Street, Brooklyn, 1985.</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 396px; top: 700px; width: 132px; height: 92px; transform: rotate(-6deg)"><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 10px; width: 132px; height: 82px; background: #fbf8f2; border: 1px solid #d8cdbd; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(40,20,10,0.35)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: -3px; top: 0; width: 138px; height: 26px; background: #fffdf8; border: 1px solid #d8cdbd; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(40,20,10,0.2)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 58px; top: 0; width: 16px; height: 92px; background: #94702f"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 46px; width: 132px; height: 14px; background: #94702f"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 44px; top: 36px; width: 44px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; border: 5px solid #b48b42; box-sizing: border-box"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 66px; width: 120px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Pirata One', serif; font-size: 18px; color: #5f1a26; line-height: 1">Confetti</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 536px; top: 770px; width: 24px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #ffffff, #fbf3ee 55%, #c9b9ae); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(40,20,10,0.35); transform: rotate(18deg)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 520px; top: 792px; width: 24px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #ffffff, #f3d9dd 55%, #c9b9ae); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(40,20,10,0.35); transform: rotate(-24deg)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 552px; top: 796px; width: 24px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #ffffff, #fbf3ee 55%, #c9b9ae); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(40,20,10,0.35); transform: rotate(40deg)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 502px; top: 804px; width: 24px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #ffffff, #e9eef2 55%, #c9b9ae); box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(40,20,10,0.35); transform: rotate(8deg)"></div><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 600px; height: 1200px; display: block; opacity: 0.2"><img src="assets/era/prizzis/wear-back-5ff5da.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 600px; height: 1200px; display: block"></div>`
