`<div style="position: relative; width: 408px; height: 1056px; overflow: hidden; background: #e3e8d6"><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 408px; height: 236px; background: #4a1418"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 228px; width: 408px; height: 3px; background: #a8832f"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 44px; width: 328px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #a8832f; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1;">The Hotel Wexford<br>Grand Ballroom</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 84px; width: 328px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.0; color: #e3e8d6">THE<br>MEETING</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 196px; width: 328px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; color: #e8d6a4">A private dinner of the families</div><img src="assets/era/sobelsupper/hero-couch-332c6c.webp" alt="Paul Vitti on the couch in Dr. Sobel's office, palms up, mid-sentence, close to tears" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 231px; display: block; width: 408px; height: 340px"><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 571px; width: 408px; height: 3px; background: #a8832f"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 583px; width: 328px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.25; color: #5b4a44">Our host, in session. He is fine. He is totally fine.</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 240px; top: 256px; width: 132px; height: 212px; transform: rotate(6deg)"><div style="position: absolute; left: 65px; top: -24px; width: 2px; height: 32px; background: #8a7b62"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 132px; height: 212px; background: #fbfaf5; border: 1.5px solid #8a7b62; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px 6px 0; text-align: center"><div style="position: absolute; left: 59px; top: 6px; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid #8a7b62; background: #e3e8d6"></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #4a1418; line-height: 1.2">DO NOT REMOVE<br>THIS TAG</div><div style="font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 20px; color: #4a1418; line-height: 1.05; margin-top: 6px">HIT THE<br>PILLOW</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4a1418; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 6px">Angry? Hit this.<br>Hit, do not shoot.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 14px; color: #5b4a44; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 4px">Feathers, rage</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 24px; top: 612px; width: 360px; height: 252px; background: #4a1418; box-sizing: border-box; border: 3px double #a8832f; padding: 12px 16px 0"><div style="font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; color: #e3e8d6; white-space: nowrap; text-align: center">COCKTAIL HOUR</div><div style="margin-top: 10px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #e3e8d6"><span>Calming Negroni</span><span>8.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; color: #e3e8d6; margin-top: 2px">Gin, red bitter, sweet vermouth, orange.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 10px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #e3e8d6"><span>Antipasto platter</span><span>12.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; color: #e3e8d6; margin-top: 2px">Salami, provolone, roast peppers, olives.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #a8832f; padding-top: 7px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.3; color: #e8d6a4; text-align: center">Jelly&rsquo;s rye 6 &middot; House red 7 &middot; Prosecco 8<br><i>Jelly is at the bar. Don&rsquo;t ask him anything.</i></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 866px; width: 160px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.25; color: #4a1418">Menu arranged by the consigliere. No guns at the table, please.</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 968px; font-family: 'Allura', cursive; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; color: #4a1418">Ben Sobel</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 202px; top: 868px; width: 196px; height: 136px; background: #fbfaf5; box-shadow: 0 3px 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.38); transform: rotate(-4deg); box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 12px 0; border-top: 6px solid #4a1418"><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.05; color: #4a1418">Ben Sobel, M.D.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #5b4a44; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 2px">PSYCHIATRY</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 16px; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 6px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #b9b2a5; height: 26px">Next visit<span style="font-family: 'Allura', cursive; font-size: 27px; color: #1d3a7a; line-height: 1">Tuesday</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 16px; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 6px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #b9b2a5; height: 26px">at<span style="font-family: 'Allura', cursive; font-size: 27px; color: #1d3a7a; line-height: 1">3 a.m.</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #5b4a44">(again)</span></div></div><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 408px; height: 1056px; display: block; opacity: 0.2"><img src="assets/era/sobelsupper/wear-front-85c840.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 408px; height: 1056px; display: block"></div>`,
`<div style="position: relative; width: 408px; height: 1056px; overflow: hidden; background: #e3e8d6"><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 40px; width: 328px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #a8832f; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1;">The fifty-minute hour</div><div style="font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 35px; line-height: 1.1; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 8px; white-space: nowrap">THE SESSION</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: #5b4a44; margin-top: 4px">Eat. Talk. How does it make you feel?</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 156px; width: 328px; height: 3px; background: #4a1418"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 174px; width: 328px"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #a8832f; white-space: nowrap">SESSION ONE</div><div style="flex: 1; height: 0; border-top: 1.5px solid #a8832f"></div></div><div style="font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.15; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 4px; white-space: nowrap">START TALKING</div><div style="margin-top: 8px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #4a1418"><span>Fried calamari</span><span>11.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.22; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 3px">Semolina-crusted squid, fried crisp, lemon.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.25; color: #a8832f; margin-top: 2px">As at the Miami wedding. Interrupted.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 12px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #4a1418"><span>Mozzarella in carrozza</span><span>9.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.22; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 3px">Crumbed, fried, the cheese running.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.25; color: #a8832f; margin-top: 2px">Comfort food. Admit you need it.</div></div><div style="height: 10px"></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #a8832f; white-space: nowrap">SESSION TWO</div><div style="flex: 1; height: 0; border-top: 1.5px solid #a8832f"></div></div><div style="font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.15; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 4px; white-space: nowrap">COMFORT COURSE</div><div style="margin-top: 8px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #4a1418"><span>Rigatoni, Sunday gravy</span><span>14.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.22; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 3px">Tomato slow-cooked with pork, basil, pecorino.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 12px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #4a1418"><span>Veal parmigiana</span><span>19.99</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.22; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 3px">Crumbed cutlet, marinara, mozzarella, parmesan, spaghetti.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.25; color: #a8832f; margin-top: 2px">Like his mother made. We won&rsquo;t go there.</div></div><div style="height: 10px"></div><div id="s3" style="width: 176px"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #a8832f; white-space: nowrap">SESSION THREE</div><div style="flex: 1; height: 0; border-top: 1.5px solid #a8832f"></div></div><div style="font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.15; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 4px; white-space: nowrap">CLOSURE</div><div style="margin-top: 8px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #4a1418"><span>Cannoli</span><span>7.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.22; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 3px">Sweet ricotta, orange zest, chocolate-dipped ends.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 10px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; color: #4a1418"><span>Espresso</span><span>2.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.22; color: #4a1418; margin-top: 3px">With sambuca, 4.00.</div></div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 240px; top: 706px; width: 124px; height: 124px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4a1418; border: 3px solid #a8832f; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #e3e8d6, 0 0 0 5px #4a1418; transform: rotate(-9deg); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 20px"><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #e8d6a4; line-height: 1">CANNOLI</div><div style="font-family: 'Chango', serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.02; color: #e3e8d6; margin-top: 6px">YOU&rsquo;RE<br>GOOD.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 15px; color: #e8d6a4; line-height: 1; margin-top: 5px">you&rsquo;re good</div></div><img src="assets/era/sobelsupper/hug-cutout-05c248.webp" alt="Paul Vitti hugging Dr. Sobel, eyes shut, cheek to cheek" style="position: absolute; left: 232px; top: 822px; display: block; width: 176px; height: 234px"><div style="position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 960px; width: 180px; font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.25; color: #5b4a44">Prices subject to change.<br>Banquet order No. 1957.<br>New York, 1999.</div><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 408px; height: 1056px; display: block; opacity: 0.2"><img src="assets/era/sobelsupper/wear-back-5467c6.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 408px; height: 1056px; display: block"></div>`
