`<div style="position: relative; width: 816px; height: 1056px; overflow: hidden; background: #f1dd96"><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 816px; height: 1056px; display: block; opacity: 0.32"><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 50px"><div style="font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #d23b2b; line-height: 1;">Kitchen open till close</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 62px; top: 84px"><div style="display: inline-block; border: 3px solid #d23b2b; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #f1dd96, 0 0 0 6px #d23b2b; padding: 7px 18px 3px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #16262c">The menu</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 356px; top: 64px; width: 404px; text-align: right; font-family: 'Monoton', sans-serif; font-size: 58px; line-height: 1.15; color: #d23b2b">LAST STOP</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 356px; top: 136px; width: 404px; text-align: right; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #16262c">BAR AND GRILL, SOHO</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 180px; width: 704px; height: 3px; background: #16262c"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 62px; top: 210px; width: 324px"><div style="display: inline-block; border: 3px solid #d23b2b; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #f1dd96, 0 0 0 6px #d23b2b; padding: 7px 18px 3px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #16262c">To start</div><div style="margin-top: 22px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Bagel bites</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">3.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Toasted minis spread thick with chive and black pepper cream cheese, smoked salmon, capers, sesame, poppy seed and garlic.</div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; color: #d23b2b; margin-top: 3px">Softer than a paperweight.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>French fries</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">1.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Hand cut, fried twice, plenty of salt.</div></div><div style="height: 2px; background: #16262c; opacity: 0.5; margin: 24px 0 26px"></div><div style="display: inline-block; border: 3px solid #d23b2b; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #f1dd96, 0 0 0 6px #d23b2b; padding: 7px 18px 3px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #16262c">Sweets</div><div style="margin-top: 22px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Plaster of Paris cake</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">2.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Vanilla butter layers under seven-minute frosting, roughed up with a palette knife to set white and matte.</div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; color: #d23b2b; margin-top: 3px">For the sculptors on the block.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Dipped cone</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">1.75</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Vanilla soft serve dipped in dark chocolate that sets to a shell, then crushed peanuts or sprinkles.</div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; color: #d23b2b; margin-top: 3px">Better than the truck.</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 436px; top: 210px; width: 324px"><div style="display: inline-block; border: 3px solid #d23b2b; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #f1dd96, 0 0 0 6px #d23b2b; padding: 7px 18px 3px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #16262c">Behind the bar</div><div style="margin-top: 22px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Whiskey sour</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">3.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Bourbon, lemon, a little sugar and egg white shaken silky, bitters on the foam, a cherry.</div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; color: #d23b2b; margin-top: 3px">Tom shakes them hard.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Draft beer</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">1.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Cold, in a heavy mug.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Shot and a beer</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">2.75</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Rye or bourbon with a draft back.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #16262c; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Coffee</span><span style="color: #d23b2b">.90</span></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 19.5px; line-height: 1.38; color: #16262c; margin-top: 3px">Fresh pot all night, refills free.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 24px; border: 3px solid #d23b2b; padding: 4px; background: #f6efd9"><img src="assets/era/sohoaftermidnight/still-bar-b52438.webp" alt="The bartender and a customer at the bar late at night" style="display: block; width: 312px; height: 100px; object-fit: cover"></div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.35; color: #16262c; margin-top: 6px">The bar, a quiet night after midnight.</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 436px; top: 846px; width: 324px"><div style="font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #d23b2b; line-height: 1;">From behind the bar</div><div style="font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.42; color: #16262c; margin-top: 8px">Lock up, there have been burglaries on the block. Off to Club Berlin? Eat first.</div><div style="font-family: 'Mrs Saint Delafield', cursive; font-size: 54px; line-height: 1; color: #d23b2b; margin-top: -4px">Tom</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 668px; top: 708px; width: 104px; height: 104px; border-radius: 52px; background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 34%, #f3d98a 0%, #c99b3e 55%, #8f6a25 100%); box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); transform: rotate(12deg)"><div style="position: absolute; left: 7px; top: 7px; width: 86px; height: 86px; border-radius: 43px; border: 2px solid #8a6421"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 17px; width: 104px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; line-height: 1; color: #5c4214">GOOD FOR</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 39px; top: 38px; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 13px; background: #132b34"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 71px; width: 104px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; line-height: 1; color: #5c4214">ONE FARE</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 990px; width: 420px; height: 1px; background: #16262c; opacity: 0.5"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 996px; width: 420px; font-family: 'PT Serif', serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.3; color: #16262c">Cash only. Prices subject to change. Form 1985.</div><img src="assets/era/sohoaftermidnight/wear-back-578d3d.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 816px; height: 1056px; display: block"></div>`
