`<div style="position: relative; width: 1123px; height: 794px; overflow: hidden; background: #f3f2ee"><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 1123px; height: 794px; display: block; opacity: 0.22"><div style="position: absolute; left: 48px; top: 40px; width: 466px"><div style="font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; color: #2b4f9e; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">Chapter one</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'Poiret One', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05; color: #161618; -webkit-text-stroke: 0.9px #161618; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap">At the bar</span><span style="flex: 1; height: 7px; border-top: 2px solid #161618; border-bottom: 1px solid #2b4f9e; margin-top: 6px"></span></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Manhattan</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">2.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Rye, sweet vermouth and bitters, stirred cold, with a cherry.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.25; color: #2b4f9e; margin-top: 1px">The pitcher for your table, 17.00.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Crostini misti</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">2.75</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Little rounds of French bread, toasted. Ricotta with lemon peel and honey, or mushrooms, garlic and thyme under Parmesan.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Shrimp cocktail</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">4.95</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Jumbo shrimp, poached and well chilled, with a sharp horseradish sauce and lemon.</div></div><div style="height: 20px"></div><div style="font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; color: #2b4f9e; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">Chapter two</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'Poiret One', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05; color: #161618; -webkit-text-stroke: 0.9px #161618; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap">Sunday brunch</span><span style="flex: 1; height: 7px; border-top: 2px solid #161618; border-bottom: 1px solid #2b4f9e; margin-top: 6px"></span></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Sutton Place platter</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">5.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Toasted bagels, cream cheese, sliced Nova, capers, red onion cut thin and fresh dill.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.25; color: #2b4f9e; margin-top: 1px">Wrapped to go for the bench by the bridge.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Belgian waffles</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">3.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Crisp squares, maple syrup, sweet butter, berries in season.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.25; color: #2b4f9e; margin-top: 1px">Dachshunds welcome at brunch.</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 610px; top: 40px; width: 466px"><div style="font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; color: #2b4f9e; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">Chapter three</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'Poiret One', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05; color: #161618; -webkit-text-stroke: 0.9px #161618; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap">Late supper</span><span style="flex: 1; height: 7px; border-top: 2px solid #161618; border-bottom: 1px solid #2b4f9e; margin-top: 6px"></span></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Chicken Kung Pao</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">7.25</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Diced dark meat stir-fried hot with dried red peppers, soy, rice wine and black vinegar. Roasted peanuts, scallions and rice.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.25; color: #2b4f9e; margin-top: 1px">Szechuan style. Packed to go for the late movie.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Linguine, white clam</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">7.75</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Littlenecks opened in garlic, oil and white wine, with parsley and red pepper.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Veal piccata</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">9.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Thin scallops saut&eacute;ed in butter, lemon, capers and vermouth.</div></div><div style="height: 20px"></div><div style="font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; color: #2b4f9e; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">Chapter four</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'Poiret One', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05; color: #161618; -webkit-text-stroke: 0.9px #161618; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap">Desserts</span><span style="flex: 1; height: 7px; border-top: 2px solid #161618; border-bottom: 1px solid #2b4f9e; margin-top: 6px"></span></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>NY cheesecake</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">2.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Lemon and vanilla on a buttery crumb crust. Baked slow, chilled overnight.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.25; color: #2b4f9e; margin-top: 1px">Worth living for, the regulars say.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 13px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Josefin Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.1; color: #161618; letter-spacing: 0.005em"><span>Pears in red wine</span><span style="color: #2b4f9e">2.25</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.26; color: #161618; margin-top: 3px">Bosc halves poached with cinnamon and orange peel, with cream.</div><div style="font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.25; color: #2b4f9e; margin-top: 1px">Our answer to C&eacute;zanne.</div></div></div><img src="assets/era/gershwinfolio/wear-inside-60b065.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 1123px; height: 794px; display: block"></div>`
